WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.440
'I need an intern to work with me.'

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:04.420
'I'll choose them myself.'

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.710
'Who?
- Teju.'

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.990
'I told you, right?'

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.060
'If I die, I'll die in your
hospital, in your lap.'

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.160
'Did you forget?'

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.610
'I had asked you for a job.'

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.110
'After all that happened,
if you come back to this hospital'

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.450
'I don't think it will be good.'

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.600
'Hope you understand.'

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:22.190
'Who is it?'

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:25.490
'Hi.'

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.960
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.350
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.000
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:59.950
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.660
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:05.290
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:08.080
♪ I am also a doctor ♪

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.240
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:18.210
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:24.820
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:38.720
What are you doing here?

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:44.700
What am I doing here?

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:49.840
Why did I even bother to check up
on you as your sister?

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.420
In our childhood, our father..

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:57.390
No, no.

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:58.610
Your father

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.690
gave me away to his sister
because she didn't have a child.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:04.680
Why did he give me away?

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.520
Because he just wanted his sons

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:09.720
to take care of him
and his wealth.

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:14.850
But what are those sons doing now?

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:21.060
The girl child he gave away
has come to save you now.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:23.270
Why are you telling me
old stories now?

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.640
Did I ask you for help?

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:25.650
You didn't ask.

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.020
Even if you didn't ask,
I know what you are feeling.

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:31.880
This is called sibling instincts.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:34.400
I know that you are suffering.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.880
In a way, I am glad about it.

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:40.640
But my mind doesn't accept it.

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:45.100
Are you going to give me money now?

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.100
I don't need money now.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:48.910
I need a job.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.870
Don't think small,
asking for a job.

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:54.630
I will get you back that hospital.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:58.480
It's too late.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:00.640
It's all over now.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.950
Don't create a mess now.
Do you understand?

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.060
Why?

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.560
Since when did you
start avoiding problems?

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:13.390
I tried everything
to get the hospital back.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.560
But all my plans failed.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:19.430
In the end, when the creditors
came to ask for money

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:20.640
no one came to help me.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:21.850
But Arjun came.

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:24.730
Arjun came forward
and took care of my debts.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:28.030
Is that why you
gave up the hospital

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.630
and started looking for a job?

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.810
Are you getting angry?

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:37.310
This is what I feel.

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:38.680
Do you know why?

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:42.370
You tried to get that hospital
back since you're suffering.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:43.390
But you didn't get it.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.090
But I am not suffering.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:47.240
I have an ego.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:51.460
When I was young, our father
selected you and gave me away.

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.540
Shouldn't I show
that I am better than you?

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:56.560
That's why.

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:59.200
I will give you the money
that Arjun gave you.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:02.210
Similarly, ask him to return
the place that father gave him.

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:04.020
Will he give you?

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:05.180
He won't give it back.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.030
Exactly.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:09.850
But I will make him return it.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.350
What will you do?

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:14.910
If anything happens to the hospital

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:16.300
Arjun is not the only one there.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.880
Everyone will support him.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:20.130
Even if there is
a problem between them

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.670
they will manage it.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:23.790
They won't let it
affect the hospital.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:26.000
What if I break their strength?

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.500
What if I turn
everyone against Arjun?

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:34.000
What if I make them think that
Arjun is the reason for everything?

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:39.560
No matter who you support

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.470
think twice before you decide.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:45.790
Soon, the hospital will be ours.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.580
Kiran, come with me.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:00.520
What is it?
- Come.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.100
There is a problem. Come
with me. - What happened?

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:05.390
It is an important matter. Come
- I am asking you what happened.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.600
A guy is torturing me.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:08.400
You have to beat him up.
- Is it a love matter?

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.960
In a way, this is also love.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:11.710
Love is the reason
for all problems.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:13.460
Why didn't you tell me sooner?
- Hey!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.890
I have known you for a month.

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:16.910
Yes.
- Come..

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:20.380
Where are you both
going in such a hurry?

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.890
Rocky, someone is torturing
Nilofer for a long time.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.230
She wants me to beat them.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.000
Okay.

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.060
Tell me.
What should I do?

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:35.640
Stop kidding, Rocky.
- Oh, God..

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.310
Tell me.
What should I do?

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:40.770
Get lost.
- What?

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:43.230
Wait.
I will also come with you.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:45.730
Come fast.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:47.010
Will she get us beaten?

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:50.060
Nilofer, how long have
they been torturing you?

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.560
From morning to night.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:53.710
How many of them?

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.080
One person.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:57.680
One person?

00:05:58.130 --> 00:05:59.020
I don't understand.

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:01.180
You have to beat him up.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.000
I am talking to him.

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.230
Wow!

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:06.400
Is he a big shot?

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:07.500
Okay.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:10.180
He looks a bit old.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.090
What is he torturing you for?

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:14.870
He is my father.

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:17.770
What?
- Your father?

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:20.120
Do I have to beat your father?

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:21.980
Yes. He has been torturing
me since my childhood.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.650
He tortures me for everything.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.520
He tortured me
from school to college.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.100
He tortured me
to take biology group.

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:28.440
He tortured me
to study medicine.

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:30.600
After finishing college,
he tortured me to get a job.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:32.070
After all this..

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.480
He is torturing me to get married.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.430
I can't, Kiran.
I can't.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:36.760
Me too.

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:37.730
Look.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:39.100
Save me from him.

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:40.520
At least break his mouth.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:41.910
He shouldn't talk
for at least two days.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.140
You fool!

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:45.070
Who will beat their father up?

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:46.560
I can't do it.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:47.980
So much grudge.
- Hey..

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:49.720
He is old.

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:52.210
Why don't you give him
some pills for dysentery?

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.130
Two are enough.
He won't talk for four days.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:58.420
He has high immunity. He will
ask for more after getting drunk.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.160
Is that so?
- Idiot.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:02.390
Kiran, please.
You have to do something.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:05.010
I can't do it. Leave me
alone. I have work. Bye.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:05.800
Kiran, Kiran.

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:07.770
Just do what I say, okay?

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:10.520
Rocky, what do we do now?
- Tell me. What should I do?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:12.850
Don't irritate me, Rocky.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.020
I will do something.
- Hey, stop.

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:20.140
Your father
is leaning on a car, right?

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:22.930
Did he take it on rent?

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:25.430
No. It's ours.
- Yours?

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.810
That car is very expensive.

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:31.100
Maybe.
I don't know about that.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.290
He will get it for me.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:34.180
Will you pay the loan together?

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.390
He has three cars
like this for his use.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.110
I'm planning for a grand wedding.
- What..

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.890
Why did you say that you are
the first doctor in your family?

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.390
Yes.
I am the first doctor.

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:47.080
Others are in different domains
like business and law.

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:51.770
I thought you were poor
to study hard like me.

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.920
Hey, I did study hard.
Why don't you understand?

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.900
Go.
I will take care.

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:00.730
You are testing me again.

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:04.730
Take care.
- Okay.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:24.520
Reena, what happened?

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.960
What are you thinking about?
- Narmada's reports have come.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:29.370
Oh!

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:31.810
What is the result?
- CBC results have come.

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.720
WBC is 28,000.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.300
It should be around 11,000.
But this is bad.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:38.390
Okay.
What should we do now?

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.960
Surgery is the only option.

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:42.270
We have to amputate the toe.

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:45.430
Then why don't you ask
Dr. Preetham and proceed?

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:46.720
Dr. Preetham is not here.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.920
He has gone out.
He is not answering my calls.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:49.930
Mr. Arjun.

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:53.210
Yes, sir. I called him.
But he is not answering my calls.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.180
Is he not on duty?

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:57.710
Where has he gone now?
- How would I know, Arjun?

00:08:57.810 --> 00:08:59.880
We can proceed further
only if he comes here.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.930
Then, why don't you ask
Dr. Radhi for a suggestion?

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:04.930
Dr. Radhi?

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:07.340
No, sir. If he comes to know,
it will be a problem.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:09.730
I'm telling you.

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.390
You go and ask her, Reena.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:13.520
No, Arjun.

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:15.180
It will be a problem.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.140
Doctor.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.110
Nurse, give her the Midas.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.020
Start the inotropic immediately.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.270
Reena, I'm telling you.
- Wait..

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:27.980
Go and consult Dr. Radhi.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:31.930
Ma'am..

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:35.840
What are you doing here?
- An emergency case.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:38.730
If it is an emergency case,
ask Dr. Preetham.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.850
Why are you coming to me?
- He is not here.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.920
Even if he is not here,
how can I look into his case?

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:51.750
It's not right for you to come and
discuss Dr. Preetham's case with me.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.050
This is what happened
in Ganga's case this morning.

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:55.980
I am not here to argue with you.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:58.090
Arjun asked me to consult you.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.170
If Dr. Preetham was here,
wouldn't I have asked him?

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:01.640
Reena.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.380
Don't raise your voice.
- Then?

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:07.500
I came here with an emergency case,
but you're not even listening to me.

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:08.980
There is a patient named Narmada.

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:10.560
She was admitted
with a diabetic foot.

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:13.750
When I checked, her WBC
level is higher than normal.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.750
I came to consult you about that.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.230
I couldn't reach Dr. Preetham.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:44.770
Ma'am.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:48.880
Reena. After starting inotropic,
her BP has picked up well.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:52.060
But saturation
level is still low, look.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.580
Give it to me.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:02.230
Why is the BP so low
for a diabetic patient?

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.520
Patient in sepsis?

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:07.380
I think you guys
are missing something.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.360
Oh, okay.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.230
Reena, what you are doing is right.

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:18.860
Let the inotropy get infusion.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.520
Keep monitoring the vitals.
- Okay, ma'am.

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:24.140
And take the procalcitonin
and RFT tests immediately.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:27.160
Show the results
to Dr. Preetham and proceed.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.250
Okay, ma'am.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.710
If my guess is right,
we have to do dialysis.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.200
And we don't have much time.

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:37.180
Call Dr. Preetham and ask
him to come immediately.

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:39.430
Okay, ma'am.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:41.890
Yeah.

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:53.320
Who is it?

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.310
Is it Sathish's house?

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.230
Yes.

00:11:58.410 --> 00:11:59.630
Sathish is my son.

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:00.770
Who are you?

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:05.250
Ma'am, we are doctors
working in RK Hospital.

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:07.260
We want to check your house.
Can we do it?

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.430
RK Hospital?

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:11.710
Why are you asking to check
the house like police?

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:13.670
No, ma'am.

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:16.500
Your son is admitted
at the hospital.

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:17.650
Are you aware of that?

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:18.890
Yes, I am.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.500
I got a call from the hospital.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:24.090
I couldn't even go to meet him.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:26.250
How is he now?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.020
He has a lung infection, ma'am.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:32.130
Without knowing the reason,
we can't start the treatment.

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:37.140
So, we came here to collect
samples from his room.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:39.520
It would be easier
to start the treatment.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.790
He never had any allergies.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.480
Even I don't have any allergies.

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:46.180
How can he get an allergy?

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:49.530
It's not like that, ma'am.
Allergies can occur at any age.

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:51.100
What is it, Teju?

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:53.140
Move aside.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:55.480
Ma'am, where is Sathish's room?

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:56.480
It is here.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:12:59.980
You go to his room.
I will go there.

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:00.980
I will go there.

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.010
I couldn't find anything
in the living room, Teju.

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:15.310
Teju?

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:18.760
Have you ever wanted
to buy a beautiful house like this

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.380
and live in it?

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:25.180
It would be nice to live
happily in a house like this.

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:31.000
You and your brother
have ruined my life.

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:34.810
Hey! Why are you talking
about that all the time?

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:36.700
You don't know to talk
about anything else.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:38.730
Look here.

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.630
My brother's
situation was like that.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:43.170
I did what he asked me to do.
That's all.

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:44.270
Hey!
- Hey.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:46.420
You stood up for me
when I was in trouble.

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:48.760
Likewise, I helped him
when he was in trouble.

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:49.730
What is wrong in that?

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.180
What I did for you is different.

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:54.350
But what you did for
your brother is different.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:55.680
Go and do your work.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:10.970
T-There.

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.180
Hey, Teju!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.900
You said "different".
What does it mean?

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:20.560
Hey!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.540
I didn't want to get
a black mark on you.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.790
I did that to solve that problem.

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:26.810
But what did you do?

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.420
You were there to create
a problem in that hospital.

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:32.150
So..

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:33.890
Don't compare me with you.

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:35.840
How can you talk like this, Teju?

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:37.460
You know it, right?

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:41.770
I took a student loan and studied
without my family's help.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.480
Now, I'm paying that loan.

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:44.890
What..
- Hey!

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:47.020
Why are you talking
about what you did?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.810
You chose your problems.

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.200
You have options to choose.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.210
But for many people,
life itself is a problem.

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:55.640
Not everyone has options like you.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:58.730
Naveen.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.410
No matter what you say

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.060
no matter how much you explain

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:06.540
I can feel that you are acting.

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:14.060
Hey, move.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.480
Ma'am, are there many pigeons here?

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:30.310
Yes.

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.040
He likes birds a lot.

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.750
He takes photos of some
birds every now and then.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:39.210
He feeds them every day.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:43.090
And these birds will be sitting in
front of the house every morning.

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:44.780
As soon as he puts out the food

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.880
all the birds will come.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:54.210
Why did Manasa come here suddenly?

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:00.340
How long will she be here?

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.310
She hasn't told
anything about it yet.

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.390
She just came here.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:09.010
I haven't asked her about it yet.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:13.290
I heard what she said.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:17.940
She is very adamant
to get the hospital back.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.100
Everything is clear
from what she said.

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:23.420
The hospital
problem is over, right?

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:25.710
That's why so many
problems were created.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.710
Actually, when Arjun came here

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.420
he said that we are even now.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:33.590
Then, why should we
start all over again?

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:37.260
Madan.

00:18:37.730 --> 00:18:39.960
Do something else.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.380
Or, try to figure it out.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:48.090
No matter what you do,
we will be happy.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:52.290
What have you decided?

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:56.670
Sorry, did I disturb you?

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.030
No.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.380
Brother, I want to talk to you.

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:02.670
Okay, I will come.

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:04.870
I'll be back. Come on.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:14.550
Have you decided?

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:18.430
Everyone is asking
the same question.

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:21.320
Manasa, I wanted to
get the hospital back

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:24.800
to solve my financial
crisis and for my family.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:27.340
Hey, don't keep repeating
what you said.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.640
There is no reason.

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:33.710
It's not fair to get the hospital
back just for your ego.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:36.720
It's bad karma for us.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.890
I'm already suffering
a lot for what I did.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.350
For both of them..

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:45.580
Look, Manasa.

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:48.720
I won't support you in this matter.

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:52.180
I won't let you do anything
against the hospital.

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:53.520
Understand that.

00:21:03.068 --> 00:21:06.148
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:21:08.188 --> 00:21:10.518
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:21:13.228 --> 00:21:16.178
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:21:17.948 --> 00:21:20.088
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:21:20.388 --> 00:21:22.848
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:21:22.898 --> 00:21:25.488
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:21:25.858 --> 00:21:28.398
♪ I am also a doctor ♪

00:21:30.778 --> 00:21:33.438
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:21:35.838 --> 00:21:38.358
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:21:40.568 --> 00:21:45.148
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:22:02.408 --> 00:22:03.228
Hey, Kiran!

00:22:04.188 --> 00:22:06.088
Won't you beat him
once for my sake?

00:22:06.228 --> 00:22:07.128
Why are you hesitating?

00:22:07.788 --> 00:22:08.658
What was it?

00:22:08.788 --> 00:22:10.588
"Hey, Kiran, come fast.
I have a problem."

00:22:11.308 --> 00:22:13.268
I thought you were serious
since you changed the tone.

00:22:13.428 --> 00:22:15.228
Hey, don't talk
without understanding.

00:22:15.348 --> 00:22:16.968
People are coming
to ask for my hand in marriage.

00:22:17.358 --> 00:22:19.378
Then it's almost confirmed.

00:22:19.548 --> 00:22:20.628
I don't care.

00:22:20.788 --> 00:22:21.718
That's your problem.

00:22:22.108 --> 00:22:24.058
But why do you ask only me?

00:22:24.428 --> 00:22:26.398
Kamal is also here, ask him.

00:22:26.868 --> 00:22:29.688
He is so worried after getting
scolded by Dr. Preetham.

00:22:29.748 --> 00:22:30.908
What will I ask him?

00:22:31.068 --> 00:22:32.868
Hey, he is your father.

00:22:33.308 --> 00:22:34.818
Why should I beat him?

00:22:35.028 --> 00:22:36.268
I am asking it as a help.

00:22:36.368 --> 00:22:37.808
Won't you beat him for my sake?

00:22:38.788 --> 00:22:39.668
I won't.

00:22:40.948 --> 00:22:41.818
Bugger.

00:22:42.308 --> 00:22:43.208
Go.

00:22:57.448 --> 00:22:58.278
Nilofer.

00:23:00.018 --> 00:23:00.798
Nilofer.

00:23:01.398 --> 00:23:02.208
What?

00:23:02.988 --> 00:23:04.148
Will you do me a favour?

00:23:05.428 --> 00:23:06.228
I won't.

00:23:07.708 --> 00:23:10.028
I listened to you when you
said you have a problem.

00:23:12.248 --> 00:23:13.208
Fine, what is it?

00:23:15.518 --> 00:23:18.188
Nothing, I want to go
on a date with Reena.

00:23:18.808 --> 00:23:19.768
So?

00:23:21.148 --> 00:23:24.348
She is always grumpy.

00:23:24.788 --> 00:23:26.818
Though I try to impress her

00:23:26.948 --> 00:23:28.428
I can't impress her.

00:23:29.468 --> 00:23:31.068
So?
- I mean..

00:23:31.548 --> 00:23:34.668
Instead of the hospital, if I
spend time with her outside

00:23:35.028 --> 00:23:36.588
she might change her opinion of me.

00:23:37.228 --> 00:23:39.428
Okay.
What should I do for that?

00:23:40.188 --> 00:23:41.188
You go and tell her.

00:23:41.458 --> 00:23:42.358
Oh!

00:23:42.588 --> 00:23:45.108
Are you asking me
to be a cupid for you guys?

00:23:45.268 --> 00:23:46.658
Hey, no..

00:23:46.748 --> 00:23:49.268
Not a cupid. I am asking
you to be a wing woman.

00:23:50.788 --> 00:23:53.018
I don't understand.
- Like a co-partner.

00:23:53.708 --> 00:23:54.748
Do this.

00:23:55.068 --> 00:23:56.888
Ask her to go on a date with you.

00:23:57.078 --> 00:23:58.938
I will come there as a coincidence.

00:24:00.748 --> 00:24:01.828
What nonsense.

00:24:01.988 --> 00:24:02.848
It is a disgrace.

00:24:03.868 --> 00:24:06.028
You asking me to hit your
father wasn't disgraceful?

00:24:11.908 --> 00:24:13.028
Okay, I will do it.

00:24:14.828 --> 00:24:16.828
I don't want to do this.

00:24:16.968 --> 00:24:18.858
If you stop my wedding,
I will do it.

00:24:19.108 --> 00:24:21.028
Hey, that's not a big deal.

00:24:21.488 --> 00:24:24.808
If you search '100 ways to stop
a marriage', there are many videos.

00:24:25.308 --> 00:24:26.188
I will take care of it.

00:24:27.668 --> 00:24:30.058
If you bring Reena for me

00:24:30.468 --> 00:24:32.828
the three of us can go
on a date to a coffee shop.

00:24:32.948 --> 00:24:35.388
Hey. How is it a date
if the three of us go together?

00:24:35.548 --> 00:24:37.388
That will happen.
I will take care of it.

00:24:38.858 --> 00:24:40.688
If you do something
cringe over there

00:24:40.948 --> 00:24:42.228
I will make fun of you.

00:24:43.068 --> 00:24:44.308
Wait and watch.

00:24:44.628 --> 00:24:48.148
Both of you will get impressed
by my style and performance.

00:24:49.298 --> 00:24:50.578
I will break
your father's jaw in return.

00:24:50.708 --> 00:24:51.628
Okay. Deal.

00:24:52.558 --> 00:24:53.348
Deal.

00:24:55.108 --> 00:24:57.288
Reena, the reports
are in this file, right?

00:24:57.988 --> 00:24:59.118
Yeah.
- Reena.

00:24:59.168 --> 00:25:00.148
Sir.
- What is the update?

00:25:00.748 --> 00:25:03.588
Sir, Narmada's blood pressure
had suddenly plummeted.

00:25:03.678 --> 00:25:05.758
So, we took Procalcitonin
and RFT tests.

00:25:06.068 --> 00:25:07.588
Both are at more
than normal levels.

00:25:09.388 --> 00:25:10.828
Who asked you to run these tests?

00:25:14.508 --> 00:25:16.618
Dr. Radhi asked me to run them.
- Radhi?

00:25:17.348 --> 00:25:19.028
Why is she interfering
in this case?

00:25:20.028 --> 00:25:21.468
We couldn't reach you, sir.

00:25:21.788 --> 00:25:23.988
So, Arjun asked me to consult her.

00:25:24.588 --> 00:25:27.268
If you can't reach me,
will you change the doctor?

00:25:28.028 --> 00:25:30.188
I am still the chief doctor
in this hospital.

00:25:32.328 --> 00:25:34.398
She said she won't
take up this case.

00:25:34.668 --> 00:25:36.108
But I insisted.

00:25:36.348 --> 00:25:37.348
Why?
- Sir.

00:25:37.828 --> 00:25:39.668
You know me, right?
You were with her, right?

00:25:39.948 --> 00:25:43.038
Why didn't you tell her?
- Sir, it was an emergency.

00:25:43.868 --> 00:25:45.528
So, instead of waiting for you..

00:25:46.588 --> 00:25:48.738
Sir, I took the decision.
Not her.

00:25:48.828 --> 00:25:49.788
How can you take it?

00:25:50.028 --> 00:25:52.188
When I took up her case,
she created such a problem.

00:25:52.348 --> 00:25:53.748
Now she is taking up my cases?

00:25:54.348 --> 00:25:57.728
Sir, she asked us to consult
you with the reports.

00:25:58.438 --> 00:25:59.808
Oh, really?
What else did she say?

00:26:00.548 --> 00:26:02.778
She said we might
have to do dialysis.

00:26:02.938 --> 00:26:04.808
Idiot. How can she
ask you to do that?

00:26:05.348 --> 00:26:06.728
Forget the other reports.

00:26:06.948 --> 00:26:08.148
Check the WBC account.

00:26:08.548 --> 00:26:09.758
Physical evidence is enough.

00:26:09.868 --> 00:26:11.748
It's a simple case
of diabetic foot.

00:26:11.788 --> 00:26:14.218
If we treat it, we are done.

00:26:14.348 --> 00:26:15.328
Alright?
- Yes, sir.

00:26:15.868 --> 00:26:16.748
Listen.

00:26:16.938 --> 00:26:19.188
I am the chief doctor
in this hospital.

00:26:19.268 --> 00:26:21.308
I will decide who should do what.

00:26:21.548 --> 00:26:22.498
Not Radhi.

00:26:22.668 --> 00:26:27.518
I know how to diagnose
and treat my patients.

00:26:29.108 --> 00:26:29.948
Get the OT ready.

00:26:30.138 --> 00:26:32.598
We are going to start the toe
amputation. Okay, get ready soon.

00:26:33.668 --> 00:26:34.468
Sorry, sir.

00:26:35.828 --> 00:26:36.758
Last time.

00:26:46.378 --> 00:26:47.218
Kamal.

00:26:48.158 --> 00:26:49.058
Ma'am.

00:26:49.268 --> 00:26:50.648
Hi, ma'am.
- How is your work?

00:26:50.898 --> 00:26:52.018
It's going well, ma'am.

00:26:52.188 --> 00:26:53.158
Intern life?

00:26:53.748 --> 00:26:55.048
It's tough, ma'am.

00:26:55.748 --> 00:26:57.358
But it's an experience.

00:26:58.148 --> 00:26:59.608
Did you study late?

00:26:59.748 --> 00:27:00.568
Yes, ma'am.

00:27:00.688 --> 00:27:02.408
I studied something
for my family.

00:27:02.458 --> 00:27:04.178
Then I studied what
I liked. So I'm late.

00:27:05.268 --> 00:27:06.878
What about the case?

00:27:07.228 --> 00:27:08.148
Ma'am.

00:27:08.208 --> 00:27:11.558
He yelled at me when he got
to know you saw the reports.

00:27:12.588 --> 00:27:13.388
I understand.

00:27:13.488 --> 00:27:15.598
That's why I am asking you
instead of Reena.

00:27:15.748 --> 00:27:18.318
I want to know what he
said after seeing the reports.

00:27:18.388 --> 00:27:20.938
Ma'am. He said we can
do the toe removal surgery.

00:27:21.708 --> 00:27:23.648
Surgery?
Give me the reports.

00:27:28.688 --> 00:27:31.308
Kamal, she has an issue
with her toe. I am not denying it.

00:27:31.868 --> 00:27:33.628
We have to remove it.

00:27:33.678 --> 00:27:35.998
But we have to stabilise
her before that.

00:27:36.148 --> 00:27:36.948
Correct, ma'am.

00:27:36.998 --> 00:27:39.728
Procalcitonin levels are high.
Look at the RFT.

00:27:40.668 --> 00:27:44.018
If we do the surgery now, won't
her blood pressure plummet?

00:27:44.268 --> 00:27:45.258
You are right, ma'am.

00:27:45.638 --> 00:27:47.978
But what can I do?
I am just an intern.

00:27:51.978 --> 00:27:53.308
Okay, Kamal.
You carry on.

00:27:53.368 --> 00:27:54.268
I will take care of it.
- Okay, ma'am.

00:28:00.118 --> 00:28:00.938
Arjun.

00:28:02.788 --> 00:28:03.598
What is it, ma'am?

00:28:04.048 --> 00:28:06.478
These are the reports I asked them
to take regarding Narmada's case.

00:28:06.668 --> 00:28:09.628
So far, she has been getting
treated for her toe issue.

00:28:09.818 --> 00:28:11.438
But as per these reports,

00:28:11.508 --> 00:28:14.168
it has been concluded that
she has a severe septum.

00:28:14.668 --> 00:28:16.948
I don't know
if Dr. Preetham saw this.

00:28:17.068 --> 00:28:20.428
But he is preparing for a surgery
thinking it is diabetic foot.

00:28:21.418 --> 00:28:24.268
This patient needs
a dialysis treatment, Arjun.

00:28:24.388 --> 00:28:26.028
Not a diabetic foot surgery.

00:28:39.138 --> 00:28:40.098
Yes, Arjun.

00:28:46.948 --> 00:28:49.648
Dr. Radhi is saying that the
patient, Narmada has severe sepsis.

00:28:49.708 --> 00:28:51.828
And the RFT is also elevated.

00:28:53.358 --> 00:28:57.328
You said that I am the chief doctor
and that there is no change in it.

00:28:58.028 --> 00:29:00.738
Sir, this has nothing
to do with that.

00:29:01.468 --> 00:29:02.598
It's all about the patient.

00:29:03.908 --> 00:29:05.828
You will believe it
if she says that it is sepsis.

00:29:06.228 --> 00:29:08.298
But you won't believe me.
Isn't it?

00:29:09.588 --> 00:29:11.078
Sir, she evaluated this.

00:29:12.188 --> 00:29:14.108
If you give a justification
from your side

00:29:14.508 --> 00:29:15.508
the problem will be solved.

00:29:15.628 --> 00:29:17.478
I don't need to explain
anything to anyone.

00:29:18.708 --> 00:29:21.398
If my patients or their
family members ask me

00:29:21.508 --> 00:29:23.018
I will explain it to them.

00:29:24.428 --> 00:29:25.948
Ma'am, I don't
understand one thing.

00:29:26.588 --> 00:29:28.548
How do you get these reports?

00:29:28.828 --> 00:29:30.388
Sir, is that important now?

00:29:30.428 --> 00:29:32.828
Oh! Are you protecting them?

00:29:33.308 --> 00:29:34.438
I know how you got it.

00:29:34.708 --> 00:29:36.028
She is your daughter, right?

00:29:36.268 --> 00:29:37.748
She would have given it to you.

00:29:37.868 --> 00:29:38.738
Sir.

00:29:39.698 --> 00:29:41.038
Don't talk unnecessarily.

00:29:42.178 --> 00:29:43.958
If you are so concerned
about the patient

00:29:44.198 --> 00:29:45.948
you should have been here
during your duty time.

00:29:46.268 --> 00:29:49.228
Sir, a patient shouldn't be affected
because of our carelessness.

00:29:49.338 --> 00:29:52.148
Ma'am, I know how
to handle my patients.

00:29:52.228 --> 00:29:53.868
You mind your own business.

00:29:54.068 --> 00:29:54.908
Okay?

00:29:55.048 --> 00:29:57.168
Have I ever
interfered in your case?

00:29:58.508 --> 00:30:00.878
Then why did you send Naveen to
me if you didn't want to interfere?

00:30:01.108 --> 00:30:01.968
Did he say that?

00:30:02.188 --> 00:30:03.638
Did he say that I sent him?
- Sir, sir.

00:30:03.718 --> 00:30:04.598
Ma'am.

00:30:05.678 --> 00:30:06.848
Please stop.

00:30:07.778 --> 00:30:08.628
Listen, Arjun.

00:30:08.688 --> 00:30:11.268
If you trust me, let me
handle this case in my style.

00:30:11.388 --> 00:30:13.998
If not, relieve me from
the hospital. Okay?

00:30:14.988 --> 00:30:15.868
Sir.

00:30:16.498 --> 00:30:20.018
It is normal for doctors to
question each other in a hospital.

00:30:21.708 --> 00:30:23.838
You don't have
to take it so seriously.

00:30:25.468 --> 00:30:26.908
Arjun, this is his case.

00:30:26.988 --> 00:30:29.078
I don't care what he does.

00:30:29.228 --> 00:30:31.108
I won't interfere
in anything anymore.

00:30:39.968 --> 00:30:40.758
Teju.

00:30:41.988 --> 00:30:42.798
Teju.

00:30:43.548 --> 00:30:45.048
Did you notice something?

00:30:47.808 --> 00:30:50.848
Last year this time, I was angry
with you and didn't talk to you.

00:30:51.348 --> 00:30:53.988
Now, you are angry with me
and not talking to me.

00:30:54.088 --> 00:30:55.308
Isn't it a great sync?

00:30:56.238 --> 00:30:57.858
Then, this is..

00:30:58.508 --> 00:31:00.028
You are testing my patience.

00:31:01.108 --> 00:31:02.058
Be quiet.

00:31:10.748 --> 00:31:11.748
Hello, ma'am.

00:31:15.158 --> 00:31:15.948
Ma'am.

00:31:16.108 --> 00:31:18.518
We went to the patient,
Sathish's house and checked.

00:31:19.058 --> 00:31:22.218
His mother said that he
was feeding the pigeons.

00:31:22.668 --> 00:31:25.338
I suspect that it might
have triggered his allergies.

00:31:25.788 --> 00:31:28.018
I have given his blood
samples to the lab.

00:31:28.908 --> 00:31:30.248
Ma'am, not only that.

00:31:30.368 --> 00:31:33.018
The CT and blood
investigation results

00:31:33.078 --> 00:31:35.728
match perfectly
with our assumption.

00:31:35.908 --> 00:31:38.498
We can try the serology test

00:31:38.648 --> 00:31:41.808
and sputum analysis
for more confirmation.

00:31:42.228 --> 00:31:43.058
Okay.

00:31:44.228 --> 00:31:45.808
Run all the tests.

00:31:45.988 --> 00:31:47.688
We have to be sure.
- Okay.

00:31:48.388 --> 00:31:51.348
If it is confirmed, start the
dosage segment. - Yes, ma'am.

00:31:51.868 --> 00:31:54.628
And keep me updated.
- Okay, ma'am.

00:31:56.418 --> 00:31:57.238
Ma'am.

00:31:57.828 --> 00:31:58.748
All okay?

00:32:01.698 --> 00:32:02.598
No, Teju.

00:32:02.958 --> 00:32:05.478
Dr. Preetham has diagnosed a case.

00:32:05.908 --> 00:32:09.348
And he has diagnosed it correctly.
But he didn't do it completely.

00:32:09.628 --> 00:32:11.678
He is not ready to listen to me.

00:32:12.318 --> 00:32:16.978
If we do the surgery now, it will
make it more risky for the patient.

00:32:19.148 --> 00:32:19.958
Ma'am.

00:32:21.008 --> 00:32:22.618
Shall I say something?

00:32:24.398 --> 00:32:29.938
Dr. Preetham always says that he
is friendly and easily approachable.

00:32:30.248 --> 00:32:33.148
But he always defends his decisions

00:32:33.818 --> 00:32:35.188
and makes us follow it.

00:32:35.618 --> 00:32:39.258
He forces everyone
to follow his procedures.

00:32:40.178 --> 00:32:44.228
If he decides something,
it is difficult to change it.

00:32:46.248 --> 00:32:48.728
You guys concentrate
on this case, okay?

00:32:49.068 --> 00:32:51.268
You may leave now.
- Thank you, ma'am..

00:32:59.708 --> 00:33:00.508
Reena.

00:33:00.748 --> 00:33:02.638
I have collected some
reports from the lab.

00:33:09.388 --> 00:33:10.228
Reena.

00:33:10.358 --> 00:33:11.288
What?

00:33:11.508 --> 00:33:13.208
Shall we go on a date?

00:33:17.148 --> 00:33:18.368
I don't swing..

00:33:18.668 --> 00:33:20.468
No, it's not like that.

00:33:20.708 --> 00:33:22.108
I want to learn a lot from you.

00:33:22.148 --> 00:33:23.828
In fact, I need your knowledge.

00:33:23.868 --> 00:33:25.478
So, I wanted to learn..

00:33:25.538 --> 00:33:27.808
Finish your internship.
You will get that knowledge.

00:33:30.108 --> 00:33:31.778
Reena.
Come on, Reena.

00:33:32.308 --> 00:33:33.428
My life is at stake.

00:33:34.068 --> 00:33:35.498
Tell me what it is.

00:33:35.908 --> 00:33:36.878
Here?

00:33:39.188 --> 00:33:41.538
We won't get
that feel in the hospital.

00:33:41.628 --> 00:33:44.668
Let's go away from these medicines
and talk about it.

00:33:45.948 --> 00:33:47.308
What do you want to talk about?

00:33:47.628 --> 00:33:49.778
What do I want to talk about?

00:33:50.488 --> 00:33:52.648
I want to talk about your life
journey and career journey.

00:33:52.698 --> 00:33:54.858
If I learn all these,
it will be very motivating for me.

00:33:55.478 --> 00:33:57.768
I don't have to tell you that.
Anyone here can tell you.

00:34:03.268 --> 00:34:05.228
What is this?
This is too much.

00:34:06.428 --> 00:34:07.938
I don't like this hospital.

00:34:08.148 --> 00:34:11.118
No one helps me.
No one agrees to go on a date.

00:34:11.228 --> 00:34:13.788
Hey, why are you
getting so emotional?

00:34:14.458 --> 00:34:16.008
Let's talk
in the canteen later. Go.

00:34:16.228 --> 00:34:18.138
Canteen? No.

00:34:18.308 --> 00:34:19.468
In the canteen…

00:34:19.628 --> 00:34:21.748
Rocky will be there
in the canteen.

00:34:21.828 --> 00:34:24.008
He won't let us talk.
He will be talking.

00:34:24.198 --> 00:34:26.398
Let's go out somewhere. Outside.

00:34:28.988 --> 00:34:29.988
Okay, let's go.

00:34:30.468 --> 00:34:31.798
But
- Yes.

00:34:32.028 --> 00:34:32.958
Not today.

00:34:33.168 --> 00:34:35.048
Today.. It's okay.

00:34:35.228 --> 00:34:36.238
If not today, it's okay.

00:34:36.388 --> 00:34:37.478
You are coming, right?

00:34:38.478 --> 00:34:39.858
That's enough.
Thank you.

00:34:43.708 --> 00:34:45.118
Go, get back to work.

00:34:48.068 --> 00:34:50.138
What is it with you?
You gave the files, right? Leave.

00:34:50.888 --> 00:34:51.808
Okay, Reena.

00:35:13.138 --> 00:35:13.988
Reena.

00:35:14.648 --> 00:35:16.558
Why are those
two interns leaving happily?

00:35:17.188 --> 00:35:18.018
Forget them.

00:35:20.558 --> 00:35:21.648
Then Reena?

00:35:22.278 --> 00:35:24.868
How is your patient,
the school teacher?

00:35:25.988 --> 00:35:28.668
Dr. Preetham asked me to
schedule the surgery immediately.

00:35:29.708 --> 00:35:30.538
Oh.

00:35:31.188 --> 00:35:32.158
When is the surgery?

00:35:33.098 --> 00:35:34.218
The OT is occupied now.

00:35:34.628 --> 00:35:36.868
We will start
as soon as an OT is available.

00:35:39.488 --> 00:35:41.228
I couldn't proceed
because I knew it was wrong.

00:35:41.688 --> 00:35:43.478
But he didn't listen to me, Teju.

00:35:44.768 --> 00:35:46.808
What if the patient's BP drops?

00:35:47.388 --> 00:35:48.868
If Preetham sees that,

00:35:48.918 --> 00:35:50.588
there is a chance for him
to re-evaluate, right?

00:35:52.768 --> 00:35:56.398
We are giving medication
to stabilise the patient.

00:35:57.148 --> 00:35:58.348
So, there is no chance.

00:35:59.268 --> 00:36:00.308
It's inotropes, right?

00:36:00.668 --> 00:36:02.028
What if you reduce the dosage?

00:36:07.378 --> 00:36:09.728
Stopping the medication
is risky to the patient's life.

00:36:10.548 --> 00:36:12.418
It's not right
and I can't do it, Teju.

00:36:13.428 --> 00:36:14.328
Good point.

00:36:15.148 --> 00:36:16.668
But what if you
don't fix that issue

00:36:17.108 --> 00:36:18.468
and do the surgery directly

00:36:18.748 --> 00:36:20.108
and then her BP plummets?

00:36:20.528 --> 00:36:23.438
Is it okay if that
creates a problem?

00:36:25.428 --> 00:36:26.278
Think about it.

00:36:28.648 --> 00:36:30.688
No, I won't do this.

00:36:32.528 --> 00:36:33.608
She is your patient.

00:36:34.078 --> 00:36:34.938
It's your wish.

00:36:35.248 --> 00:36:36.708
Do whatever you feel is right.

00:36:46.928 --> 00:36:48.648
Did you get the signature
in the consent form, Reena?

00:36:49.188 --> 00:36:50.188
Yes, sir.

00:36:50.468 --> 00:36:52.588
We will have to remove the toe.
- Okay, sir.

00:36:52.728 --> 00:36:54.478
Don't worry.
It's just the little toe.

00:36:54.708 --> 00:36:56.658
So, there won't be
any changes in her daily life.

00:36:56.828 --> 00:36:57.728
Okay, sure, sir.

00:36:58.628 --> 00:37:00.828
If you have any other
doubts, tell me. I will explain.

00:37:00.968 --> 00:37:01.858
Okay, sir.

00:37:09.348 --> 00:37:10.678
Hi, what are you doing here?

00:37:10.948 --> 00:37:12.378
I have a doubt.

00:37:13.928 --> 00:37:14.848
Ask me, madam.

00:37:15.668 --> 00:37:17.688
Will you save our teacher?

00:37:23.088 --> 00:37:23.948
Of course.

00:37:24.148 --> 00:37:25.388
Once this surgery is over

00:37:25.628 --> 00:37:27.028
your teacher will
be back to normal.

00:37:27.148 --> 00:37:27.988
Okay?

00:37:28.168 --> 00:37:29.018
Okay, smile now.

00:37:29.528 --> 00:37:30.518
Very good.

00:37:36.168 --> 00:37:37.268
Narmada! Doctor!

00:37:44.148 --> 00:37:44.958
Sir!

00:37:58.948 --> 00:37:59.828
Sir!

00:38:01.708 --> 00:38:03.028
Doctor, what happened?

00:38:03.348 --> 00:38:04.828
Start the anti-epileptic.

00:38:07.698 --> 00:38:09.648
Sir, she should be stable with
the medication we've given her.

00:39:36.420 --> 00:39:39.690
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:39:41.700 --> 00:39:44.040
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:39:46.560 --> 00:39:49.790
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:39:51.310 --> 00:39:53.660
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:39:53.760 --> 00:39:56.190
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:39:56.270 --> 00:39:58.870
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:39:59.110 --> 00:40:01.600
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:40:04.160 --> 00:40:06.900
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:40:09.210 --> 00:40:11.570
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:40:13.910 --> 00:40:18.240
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:40:30.040 --> 00:40:31.280
Monitor her closely, okay?

00:40:31.640 --> 00:40:33.380
Doctor, Narmada..

00:40:34.600 --> 00:40:35.900
The first dialysis is over.

00:40:36.400 --> 00:40:38.270
She will be stabilised
after one or two dialysis.

00:40:38.730 --> 00:40:40.400
We have removed her toe.

00:40:40.980 --> 00:40:43.820
Thank you so much
for saving her life, Doctor.

00:40:43.930 --> 00:40:45.860
Make sure she is not stressed.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:40:45.910 --> 00:40:47.110
Can I go inside and meet her?

00:40:47.220 --> 00:40:48.900
No, please wait. They'll call you.
- Okay.

00:40:49.200 --> 00:40:51.130
Reena, Kamal, take care of her.
- Okay, sir.

00:40:51.870 --> 00:40:53.950
Kamal, next patient ward number..
- Yes?

00:41:30.640 --> 00:41:31.900
Ma'am, how are you feeling?

00:41:32.470 --> 00:41:33.430
I am better now.

00:41:33.720 --> 00:41:35.900
How are you all?
- We are fine..

00:41:44.110 --> 00:41:48.950
You have done a great favour
to these kids by saving Narmada.

00:41:49.930 --> 00:41:53.670
Most of the time, these kids
have some kind of complexity.

00:41:54.120 --> 00:41:56.530
It is difficult to socialise
with them.

00:41:57.000 --> 00:42:01.240
Despite all that, these kids
have bonded with Narmada.

00:42:02.110 --> 00:42:06.240
Narmada took all sorts of efforts
to develop this bond.

00:42:07.010 --> 00:42:11.560
But now, the kids were adamant to
see her when they heard she's ill.

00:42:12.120 --> 00:42:17.060
The reason for that is, Narmada
never gave up on these kids.

00:42:17.500 --> 00:42:21.370
Likewise, you also never
gave up on Narmada.

00:42:21.500 --> 00:42:23.750
Thank you so much for saving her.

00:42:38.600 --> 00:42:39.640
The idea was mine.

00:42:40.190 --> 00:42:41.610
But the praises are for you.

00:42:42.110 --> 00:42:43.270
Teju, I didn't do anything.

00:42:43.690 --> 00:42:46.360
Her BP suddenly dropped
when no one expected it.

00:42:46.570 --> 00:42:50.660
But how did it happen right when
Dr. Preetham was there, like I said?

00:42:51.110 --> 00:42:51.950
Why are you asking me?

00:42:53.120 --> 00:42:55.580
It is wrong to take credit
for others' work, Reena.

00:42:56.450 --> 00:42:57.300
What to do?

00:42:57.750 --> 00:42:59.790
In the end, you've
made me a politician too.

00:43:29.190 --> 00:43:30.240
Kamal.
- Sir?

00:43:34.870 --> 00:43:36.060
I asked you earlier.

00:43:36.470 --> 00:43:38.290
I will ask you again.
- Ask me, sir.

00:43:38.870 --> 00:43:40.040
Am I a good doctor?

00:43:40.710 --> 00:43:41.860
He has started again.

00:43:42.870 --> 00:43:44.300
I mean, sir..
- Am I not?

00:43:44.370 --> 00:43:45.380
I didn't say that.

00:43:45.670 --> 00:43:48.840
I was just trying to answer you.

00:43:49.080 --> 00:43:50.080
Okay, tell me.

00:43:51.450 --> 00:43:52.760
What should I tell you, sir?

00:43:54.010 --> 00:43:54.960
She is my patient.

00:43:55.500 --> 00:43:57.280
I have been taking care of her
since the beginning.

00:43:58.140 --> 00:43:59.520
But I couldn't figure it out.

00:44:00.070 --> 00:44:01.510
How did Radhi figure it out?

00:44:04.760 --> 00:44:08.690
Sir, when Narmada's BP dropped,
Radhi was there.

00:44:08.860 --> 00:44:10.150
That's why she figured it out.

00:44:10.190 --> 00:44:12.610
If you were there, you would
have figured it out too, right?

00:44:13.780 --> 00:44:14.570
No, no, no.

00:44:15.000 --> 00:44:15.850
You tell me.

00:44:16.590 --> 00:44:18.510
Where do you think
the mistake happened?

00:44:19.020 --> 00:44:20.110
'Oh, no.'

00:44:20.540 --> 00:44:21.750
Actually, I know the answer.

00:44:22.490 --> 00:44:24.320
But I need to know what you think.

00:44:25.130 --> 00:44:25.960
Be honest.

00:44:26.160 --> 00:44:27.590
Sir, I didn't think of anything.

00:44:27.670 --> 00:44:29.930
Hey, you are always with me.

00:44:30.130 --> 00:44:32.180
You must have thought
of something, right? Tell me.

00:44:34.050 --> 00:44:37.050
Sir, in my hometown,
we call it arrogance.

00:44:37.510 --> 00:44:39.100
But it's a strong word.

00:44:39.210 --> 00:44:41.400
In English, it is 'arrogance'..
- Yes, arrogance.

00:44:41.730 --> 00:44:44.660
That arrogance
has brought me so far.

00:44:44.810 --> 00:44:46.190
It has kept me in this position.

00:44:46.920 --> 00:44:50.720
So, if Narmada survives, they
will say that Radhi is the reason.

00:44:50.850 --> 00:44:53.000
How can they say that, sir?
How can they?

00:44:53.360 --> 00:44:55.160
Who made the decision
at the last minute?

00:44:55.360 --> 00:44:56.380
It's you, right?

00:44:58.510 --> 00:44:59.680
Hey.
- Sir?

00:45:00.170 --> 00:45:01.600
Are you really innocent?

00:45:02.080 --> 00:45:03.720
Or are you pretending
to be innocent?

00:45:04.040 --> 00:45:05.470
Sir, that is…

00:45:05.750 --> 00:45:07.480
Get to work.
- Thank you, sir.

00:45:11.970 --> 00:45:13.780
Kamal.
- You are a good doctor, sir.

00:45:13.900 --> 00:45:15.510
A good doctor indeed..

00:45:17.000 --> 00:45:18.230
'I've escaped for today.'

00:45:18.610 --> 00:45:19.500
Oh, God.

00:45:20.580 --> 00:45:21.380
Come.

00:45:25.550 --> 00:45:27.090
Why is it so hot outside?

00:45:28.130 --> 00:45:29.960
When we come out
after being inside all day

00:45:30.040 --> 00:45:31.590
it feels like we are in an oven.

00:45:31.910 --> 00:45:34.020
That's why, whether
I am inside or outside

00:45:34.210 --> 00:45:36.170
I apply sunscreen daily.

00:45:36.250 --> 00:45:37.500
I think you know.

00:45:37.610 --> 00:45:39.960
Even when we are indoors,
we get exposed to UV rays.

00:45:41.660 --> 00:45:42.470
Wait.

00:45:44.570 --> 00:45:45.880
This is my best choice.

00:45:54.710 --> 00:45:57.130
Pond's Skin Institute
Sun Miracle Sunscreen.

00:46:01.050 --> 00:46:03.230
Reena, do you know
what a coincidence it is?

00:46:03.280 --> 00:46:04.750
Even I like this sunscreen a lot.

00:46:04.800 --> 00:46:08.480
Even Anitha recommended this
to me in the last medical camp.

00:46:08.540 --> 00:46:09.750
I have been using it since then.

00:46:09.830 --> 00:46:11.450
This has SPF 50+.

00:46:11.630 --> 00:46:13.370
It protects our skin solidly.

00:46:13.450 --> 00:46:15.550
Not only that, as it
contains Niacinamide

00:46:15.600 --> 00:46:17.780
it keeps our skin
healthy and bright.

00:46:18.140 --> 00:46:20.630
Do you know my skin has become
better since I started using this?

00:46:20.790 --> 00:46:22.910
There is no dullness.
Dark spots have become lighter.

00:46:23.060 --> 00:46:24.800
My skin has become
brighter than before.

00:46:24.900 --> 00:46:26.290
You are very correct, Nilofer.

00:46:26.380 --> 00:46:28.440
When I apply this,
it feels very light.

00:46:28.550 --> 00:46:30.870
Even when I wear a mask,
it doesn't feel sticky.

00:46:31.000 --> 00:46:33.280
Okay, you go and take rest.
We will meet in the evening.

00:46:34.170 --> 00:46:35.290
I already have it.

00:46:38.500 --> 00:46:41.610
Hey, you have to give pills
to your mother in half an hour?

00:46:42.620 --> 00:46:43.750
I know, senior.

00:46:44.930 --> 00:46:47.150
My mouth is bitter after
taking so many pills.

00:46:47.520 --> 00:46:50.590
It doesn't matter how bitter it is.
Take the pills.

00:46:51.570 --> 00:46:52.440
Listen to me.

00:46:52.690 --> 00:46:54.270
Only then your body
won't become weak.

00:46:54.650 --> 00:46:55.460
Okay?

00:46:57.420 --> 00:46:59.020
Hi, Radhi.
- Hi.

00:46:59.070 --> 00:47:00.510
Hi.
- How are you?

00:47:00.970 --> 00:47:02.650
I am all good.

00:47:03.610 --> 00:47:05.650
Ask him and Anitha
to behave themselves.

00:47:05.980 --> 00:47:08.160
What?
- Ma'am, I didn't do anything.

00:47:08.610 --> 00:47:09.760
You didn't do anything?

00:47:10.230 --> 00:47:11.850
What? They are giving me
so many pills!

00:47:12.120 --> 00:47:13.040
Mom.

00:47:13.910 --> 00:47:15.300
They are giving it for your good.

00:47:16.370 --> 00:47:19.150
Oh, no. All the doctors
are attacking me together.

00:47:19.540 --> 00:47:20.690
You're being ridiculous, Mom.

00:47:23.770 --> 00:47:27.190
If I knew that you are coming here,
I would have brought the cards.

00:47:30.300 --> 00:47:31.540
Hey, Teju.

00:47:32.210 --> 00:47:33.710
Why are you standing there?

00:47:35.880 --> 00:47:38.900
I was feeling bad that I didn't
get to see you in a long time.

00:47:39.590 --> 00:47:42.420
How could you just stand afar
after coming to see me?

00:47:44.230 --> 00:47:45.590
Everyone is here.

00:47:45.800 --> 00:47:49.630
I was feeling bad that
you two were not here.

00:47:50.510 --> 00:47:52.570
I am happy to see you now.

00:47:52.800 --> 00:47:54.120
We are going on rounds.

00:47:54.290 --> 00:47:55.750
We just wanted
to drop in and say hi.

00:47:56.770 --> 00:47:59.190
You don't worry.
I am fine.

00:48:00.600 --> 00:48:02.000
Okay, take care of your health.

00:48:02.330 --> 00:48:03.420
Don't stress.

00:48:04.120 --> 00:48:05.550
Okay.
- Okay, bye.

00:48:05.610 --> 00:48:06.500
Bye, ma'am.

00:48:06.720 --> 00:48:07.880
Come often, Teju.

00:48:09.050 --> 00:48:09.840
Sure, ma'am.

00:48:18.020 --> 00:48:21.780
Why are you always glaring at Teju?

00:48:22.980 --> 00:48:25.800
There was a big incident here.
Don't you know about it?

00:48:27.160 --> 00:48:29.380
He was angry with Naveen.

00:48:30.050 --> 00:48:33.730
When he came to know that Teju
did it, he got angry with her.

00:48:34.850 --> 00:48:36.140
Do you find it funny?

00:48:36.620 --> 00:48:40.790
Hey, are you still angry
with Teju for what happened?

00:48:41.350 --> 00:48:42.980
Naveen himself forgave her.

00:48:43.350 --> 00:48:44.300
What about you?

00:48:45.300 --> 00:48:48.050
Until I exposed her, she didn't
accept her mistake even though

00:48:48.100 --> 00:48:49.850
she knew that
people was suffering.

00:48:50.280 --> 00:48:51.570
How can you ask me to forgive her?

00:48:51.890 --> 00:48:52.760
Oh.

00:48:53.710 --> 00:48:54.550
Okay.

00:48:55.500 --> 00:48:56.960
Then, why did you forgive me?

00:48:57.590 --> 00:48:58.670
Because I am going to die?

00:48:59.700 --> 00:49:01.530
Mom, that is different.

00:49:02.360 --> 00:49:03.340
What is different?

00:49:05.760 --> 00:49:07.450
You have suffered
a lot because of me.

00:49:07.840 --> 00:49:10.090
Yet you forgave me.
Why can't you forgive her?

00:49:11.650 --> 00:49:12.590
I can't, Mom.

00:49:13.120 --> 00:49:14.960
I'm asking why.

00:49:16.260 --> 00:49:18.900
She would have reacted
like that in that situation.

00:49:19.200 --> 00:49:20.050
That's all.

00:49:21.380 --> 00:49:23.640
Will you be angry with her

00:49:23.660 --> 00:49:26.610
for the rest of your life
and not talk to her?

00:49:26.800 --> 00:49:27.610
Yes.

00:49:29.680 --> 00:49:33.150
Everyone here will be
doing something wrong.

00:49:33.740 --> 00:49:36.070
Then you won't be able
to talk to anyone.

00:49:37.410 --> 00:49:39.030
It's okay.
I am like that.

00:49:43.730 --> 00:49:48.200
Your anger and hatred
might be fine now.

00:49:50.320 --> 00:49:55.280
But when you are at the last
stage of your life like me..

00:49:57.330 --> 00:49:59.070
This is nothing.

00:49:59.740 --> 00:50:01.700
I am not saying this just for Teju.

00:50:02.260 --> 00:50:05.950
You need heart
and maturity to forgive someone.

00:50:19.900 --> 00:50:20.840
Hey, Nilofer.

00:50:21.280 --> 00:50:23.110
You really don't want
to get married, right?

00:50:23.780 --> 00:50:25.960
That's why I brought you both here.

00:50:26.380 --> 00:50:28.150
Then, why are you
getting ready like this?

00:50:28.590 --> 00:50:29.590
It's a tradition.

00:50:30.520 --> 00:50:32.450
Do they still follow
this tradition?

00:50:33.410 --> 00:50:37.050
Instead of standing here, why
don't you go and plan to stop it?

00:50:37.490 --> 00:50:38.950
That's a five-minute job.

00:50:39.290 --> 00:50:40.380
Rocky, come.

00:50:40.550 --> 00:50:41.350
Wait.

00:50:41.490 --> 00:50:42.840
Why are you so interested in this?

00:50:46.590 --> 00:50:47.750
Look here, Nilofer.

00:50:48.310 --> 00:50:50.000
You are the first
doctor in your family.

00:50:50.290 --> 00:50:51.960
I am the only doctor
in my community.

00:50:52.350 --> 00:50:55.350
What if something happens and
I have to go to the police station?

00:50:55.730 --> 00:50:57.490
Don't worry.
Nothing like that will happen.

00:50:57.620 --> 00:51:01.220
Even if that happens,
I will come and save you.

00:51:01.760 --> 00:51:02.830
Will you save me?

00:51:03.640 --> 00:51:06.320
Rocky, you asked me why I
am so interested in this, right?

00:51:06.540 --> 00:51:09.430
If I help her,
she said she will help me.

00:51:09.780 --> 00:51:10.630
That's all.

00:51:11.850 --> 00:51:12.840
Do whatever you want.

00:51:13.090 --> 00:51:15.130
But don't leave me in your deal.

00:51:16.210 --> 00:51:18.500
We will take care of that, Rocky.
You come.

00:51:20.100 --> 00:51:21.310
Go.
- I am going.

00:51:22.150 --> 00:51:22.960
Look at her.

00:51:27.800 --> 00:51:28.620
Rocky.

00:51:29.430 --> 00:51:30.260
Look there.

00:51:31.550 --> 00:51:32.720
The groom is standing there.

00:51:34.340 --> 00:51:35.920
Go.
Go and talk to him.

00:51:36.450 --> 00:51:39.630
Hey, why should I talk to him?
You go and do it.

00:51:40.210 --> 00:51:43.650
Rocky, you are the senior.
It'll be correct if you do it. Go.

00:51:44.370 --> 00:51:45.260
Me?

00:51:45.810 --> 00:51:47.170
He looks terrible.
- Go on!

00:51:47.950 --> 00:51:49.050
Did you check the files?

00:51:52.010 --> 00:51:52.860
Greetings, groom.

00:51:53.510 --> 00:51:54.420
Greetings.

00:51:55.290 --> 00:51:56.340
Why are you on the balcony?

00:51:57.000 --> 00:51:58.700
To smoke?
- No, bro.

00:51:58.910 --> 00:52:00.280
Just to get some fresh air.

00:52:00.460 --> 00:52:01.300
That's all.

00:52:01.750 --> 00:52:03.510
By the way, I am Rocky.

00:52:03.660 --> 00:52:05.690
The tall one is Kiran.

00:52:05.770 --> 00:52:06.590
He is my junior.
- Hi.

00:52:06.710 --> 00:52:09.360
We both work with Nilofer.
We are close friends.

00:52:09.680 --> 00:52:10.500
Okay.

00:52:11.880 --> 00:52:14.470
So, what do you know about Nilofer?

00:52:15.820 --> 00:52:16.800
She is a good girl.

00:52:17.430 --> 00:52:18.710
She is dedicated to her work.

00:52:19.210 --> 00:52:20.650
I have heard a lot about her.

00:52:20.800 --> 00:52:22.210
She is a good dancer.

00:52:22.330 --> 00:52:25.780
These are just her parents' words.

00:52:25.860 --> 00:52:27.380
Nilofer is not like that.

00:52:27.540 --> 00:52:29.170
She is beyond all this.

00:52:29.620 --> 00:52:30.550
Oh.

00:52:30.790 --> 00:52:31.630
Interesting girl.

00:52:32.230 --> 00:52:33.860
Shall I tell you
something interesting?

00:52:33.930 --> 00:52:35.650
She only has male friends.

00:52:35.880 --> 00:52:38.650
She has categorised them
as boyfriend and boy besties.

00:52:39.400 --> 00:52:43.130
In our hospital, she has dated
from compounder to senior doctor.

00:52:43.330 --> 00:52:45.210
Oh.
- What? Oh?

00:52:46.000 --> 00:52:47.630
Let me tell you
another important thing.

00:52:47.830 --> 00:52:50.610
She has to go
on at least two dates a day.

00:52:50.960 --> 00:52:53.320
She dates till she gets bored
and then she ghosts them.

00:52:53.650 --> 00:52:56.290
Even now, we both have come.

00:52:56.560 --> 00:52:58.500
Because she doesn't
have any female friends.

00:52:58.650 --> 00:53:00.200
She is not even a girl.

00:53:00.660 --> 00:53:01.470
What?

00:53:02.410 --> 00:53:03.210
No, bro.

00:53:03.290 --> 00:53:05.280
If you don't want her,
you can say no now.

00:53:05.400 --> 00:53:06.200
It's over.

00:53:06.910 --> 00:53:07.710
Bro.

00:53:07.870 --> 00:53:08.880
What is wrong in this?

00:53:09.010 --> 00:53:11.150
When my ex is getting
married to another guy

00:53:11.250 --> 00:53:13.520
I can get married
to another guy's ex, right?

00:53:14.610 --> 00:53:15.490
Wow.

00:53:16.340 --> 00:53:17.460
He is so shameless.

00:53:17.860 --> 00:53:18.780
What, bro?

00:53:19.620 --> 00:53:20.440
No, bro.

00:53:20.650 --> 00:53:21.910
I said you are superb.

00:53:22.490 --> 00:53:23.420
Okay.

00:53:24.670 --> 00:53:25.870
'I think he won't go.'

00:53:28.590 --> 00:53:29.390
Bro.

00:53:29.650 --> 00:53:30.670
Is your hair original?

00:53:32.280 --> 00:53:33.340
Why do you doubt it?

00:53:33.730 --> 00:53:36.590
No, bro. There are many people
roaming around with wigs now.

00:53:36.900 --> 00:53:39.460
And you are saying it's okay
to whatever I say.

00:53:39.640 --> 00:53:40.620
That's why..

00:53:40.720 --> 00:53:42.460
I have a doubt that you
are hiding something.

00:53:42.530 --> 00:53:44.340
No, no.
Original.

00:53:44.460 --> 00:53:45.710
100 percent original.

00:53:46.390 --> 00:53:47.460
Then, let's check.

00:53:48.430 --> 00:53:49.960
Let go of me.
- I won't leave you.

00:53:50.270 --> 00:53:51.340
It hurts, bro!

00:53:51.780 --> 00:53:53.140
What are you doing, bro?
- Hey, Kiran.

00:53:54.340 --> 00:53:55.210
Kiran.

00:53:55.260 --> 00:53:56.600
I hope he likes her.

00:53:57.940 --> 00:54:01.320
Bro.
- I will pluck off all your hair!

00:54:01.360 --> 00:54:02.940
You fool..

00:54:03.020 --> 00:54:04.740
Hey, Kiran.
Where is Rocky?

00:54:05.080 --> 00:54:05.960
Look there.
- Bro!

00:54:06.130 --> 00:54:07.830
Please take off your hand.
What are you doing?

00:54:07.880 --> 00:54:09.710
Hey! What is he doing?

00:54:09.820 --> 00:54:10.800
I don't know.
- It's almost over!

00:54:10.850 --> 00:54:12.380
It hurts! Bro!

00:54:12.500 --> 00:54:14.860
Which glue is it? It's so tight.
- Get lost, you fool.

00:54:15.440 --> 00:54:17.460
Fool?
- Hey, Rocky.

00:54:18.220 --> 00:54:19.040
Come here.

00:54:19.710 --> 00:54:21.460
I'll be back.
Don't tell your mom.

00:54:21.790 --> 00:54:23.400
It looks like he would rat me out.

00:54:25.170 --> 00:54:26.810
Yes.
- What?

00:54:26.890 --> 00:54:28.560
You are playing
with his hair irresponsibly.

00:54:28.720 --> 00:54:29.610
Playing?

00:54:29.920 --> 00:54:32.490
Hey. I wanted to cancel this
wedding by telling him about you.

00:54:32.560 --> 00:54:34.360
But he is saying
okay to everything.

00:54:34.570 --> 00:54:38.070
I thought he will get angry
and say no if I pull at his hair.

00:54:38.620 --> 00:54:39.460
But no use.

00:54:39.620 --> 00:54:40.710
About me?
- Yes.

00:54:40.980 --> 00:54:43.400
What did you tell him about me?
- What did I tell him about you?

00:54:43.910 --> 00:54:45.570
Nilofer has many boyfriends.

00:54:45.650 --> 00:54:47.700
She has many boy besties.
She goes on many dates.

00:54:47.830 --> 00:54:50.450
I wanted to improvise this.
But you called me back.

00:54:50.860 --> 00:54:52.750
Hey, I asked you
to stop my engagement.

00:54:52.960 --> 00:54:54.820
Why are you talking
about me like this? - No use.

00:54:54.990 --> 00:54:56.360
It was of no use.

00:54:57.210 --> 00:55:00.130
You are getting angry, right?
But he didn't even bat an eye.

00:55:00.280 --> 00:55:01.740
He is ready for everything.

00:55:02.040 --> 00:55:02.920
He is a 90's kid, I think.

00:55:03.650 --> 00:55:06.590
If you talk ill of me after this,
you're done for.

00:55:06.890 --> 00:55:08.650
Hey, we can't trust him.

00:55:08.750 --> 00:55:09.670
Do something.
- Another idea.

00:55:09.780 --> 00:55:11.590
Hey! Where are you going?

00:55:12.000 --> 00:55:13.090
Hey?
- Yes.

00:55:14.250 --> 00:55:16.380
I am going to meet his parents.
- You don't have to do anything.

00:55:16.400 --> 00:55:18.420
Shut up and stand here.
There is no use trusting you.

00:55:18.750 --> 00:55:19.900
You have to do something.

00:55:21.810 --> 00:55:22.690
I will talk to him.

00:55:30.800 --> 00:55:31.620
Reena.

00:55:33.250 --> 00:55:35.050
If you had given Narmada
the right medication

00:55:35.110 --> 00:55:36.250
her BP wouldn't have dropped.

00:55:36.660 --> 00:55:38.150
Yes, it wouldn't have.

00:55:39.050 --> 00:55:40.800
Does Dr. Preetham
know that you did this?

00:55:42.050 --> 00:55:42.920
No.

00:55:44.930 --> 00:55:47.570
Reena, you don't have any rights
to play with a patient's life.

00:55:48.560 --> 00:55:50.360
Luckily, nothing
happened this time.

00:55:50.910 --> 00:55:52.790
The patient's condition
and situation

00:55:52.850 --> 00:55:54.150
won't always be
favourable to you, Reena.

00:55:55.210 --> 00:55:56.650
I know that you don't like me.

00:55:56.830 --> 00:55:58.790
That's why, you always come to me

00:55:58.850 --> 00:56:01.450
questioning me and
always fighting with me.

00:56:02.380 --> 00:56:04.780
If it was someone else,
would you have reacted like this?

00:56:05.700 --> 00:56:06.990
You wouldn't have questioned them.

00:56:07.190 --> 00:56:08.360
I would have definitely asked.

00:56:08.430 --> 00:56:10.570
Not just you.
I would have asked anyone.

00:56:13.250 --> 00:56:14.360
I warn you, Reena.

00:56:14.750 --> 00:56:15.670
Don't repeat this.

00:56:26.610 --> 00:56:28.340
Are you the groom's parents?

00:56:28.380 --> 00:56:29.220
Yes.

00:56:29.540 --> 00:56:30.460
Who are you?

00:56:31.150 --> 00:56:32.250
I am Nilofer's friend.

00:56:32.430 --> 00:56:33.300
Oh!

00:56:33.650 --> 00:56:34.500
Is she your school friend?

00:56:35.470 --> 00:56:36.630
Yes, she is my school friend.

00:56:37.070 --> 00:56:37.860
Oh!

00:56:37.900 --> 00:56:39.780
That means you are from Nagarkovil.

00:56:39.850 --> 00:56:41.570
No, I'm from Chennai.

00:56:42.680 --> 00:56:44.590
Then, how did you
study together in school?

00:56:46.030 --> 00:56:48.830
We studied together for a month.

00:56:49.420 --> 00:56:50.250
Then, we became friends.

00:56:50.640 --> 00:56:52.960
After that,
we shifted here as a family.

00:56:54.400 --> 00:56:55.340
Okay.
- Sir.

00:56:55.830 --> 00:56:57.510
There is a logic if you
ask me about the girl.

00:56:57.730 --> 00:56:58.790
Why are you asking me about me?

00:56:59.210 --> 00:57:00.130
Do you have a daughter?

00:57:02.120 --> 00:57:04.150
I don't know how much
you know about Nilofer.

00:57:04.970 --> 00:57:07.610
Son, we've known Nilofer
since her childhood.

00:57:07.830 --> 00:57:08.950
She is a very good girl.

00:57:10.180 --> 00:57:11.900
Time has changed a lot, sir.

00:57:12.150 --> 00:57:13.880
I read a piece of news last week.

00:57:14.110 --> 00:57:18.070
A doctor was praised
by everyone around her

00:57:18.130 --> 00:57:19.800
saying that she is a good person.

00:57:19.950 --> 00:57:21.500
But she had anger issues.

00:57:22.280 --> 00:57:23.680
One day, out of anger

00:57:24.050 --> 00:57:25.240
her father-in-law..

00:57:26.190 --> 00:57:27.030
Who?

00:57:27.180 --> 00:57:28.190
Her father-in-law..

00:57:29.350 --> 00:57:30.210
She killed him.

00:57:32.280 --> 00:57:35.280
I don't read newspapers
just to avoid such news.

00:57:36.550 --> 00:57:38.110
I'm not talking about Nilofer, sir.

00:57:38.420 --> 00:57:39.380
Nilofer gets angry.

00:57:39.770 --> 00:57:42.010
But she is a good girl
as long as she is calm.

00:57:43.910 --> 00:57:44.800
Sir, do you smoke?

00:57:44.960 --> 00:57:47.720
No, I don't smoke or drink.

00:57:48.490 --> 00:57:50.340
But you see, Nilofer smokes.

00:57:51.020 --> 00:57:53.960
When she is tense during the tea
break, she smokes so much.

00:57:55.210 --> 00:57:56.200
Not only that.

00:57:56.400 --> 00:57:57.950
She organises parties often.

00:57:58.150 --> 00:58:00.680
She drinks a lot.
Half of the month

00:58:00.870 --> 00:58:02.700
she comes to the hospital hungover.

00:58:05.170 --> 00:58:06.340
Look there..

00:58:06.930 --> 00:58:07.800
Yes.

00:58:08.340 --> 00:58:11.000
The short guy
with the curly hair is Rocky.

00:58:11.500 --> 00:58:14.090
Do you know what both of them
are holding in their hands?

00:58:14.740 --> 00:58:15.670
It is juice, right?

00:58:16.430 --> 00:58:17.800
It is not an ordinary juice, sir.

00:58:18.240 --> 00:58:19.820
It is a juice mixed with vodka.

00:58:20.000 --> 00:58:21.000
It is a new variety.

00:58:21.260 --> 00:58:22.550
They have invented it.

00:58:23.230 --> 00:58:25.800
Just imagine how much they drink.

00:58:27.230 --> 00:58:30.290
It is true that friends know
the secrets that families don't.

00:58:30.760 --> 00:58:34.340
But drinking and going to parties
are common these days, right?

00:58:35.310 --> 00:58:37.750
After the wedding,
my son and Nilofer

00:58:37.870 --> 00:58:40.080
will drink together
and go to parties together.

00:58:40.520 --> 00:58:41.900
As long as they are happy.

00:58:42.330 --> 00:58:43.160
What?

00:58:44.130 --> 00:58:45.020
Nilofer?

00:58:45.750 --> 00:58:47.570
Judging from Kiran
talking to them for so long

00:58:47.980 --> 00:58:49.780
I think he will stop
your engagement.

00:58:51.380 --> 00:58:52.590
I think so too.

00:58:54.500 --> 00:58:55.880
Hey, Kiran.

00:58:56.280 --> 00:58:58.170
Come here.
- I will be back, sir.

00:59:01.490 --> 00:59:03.250
Why are you talking for so long?

00:59:03.310 --> 00:59:05.170
What did you tell them?
- All about you.

00:59:05.920 --> 00:59:06.880
What did you tell them?

00:59:07.150 --> 00:59:10.190
I told them that she parties hard
and that she smokes and drinks.

00:59:10.330 --> 00:59:11.620
Great.
- He is saying

00:59:11.670 --> 00:59:13.920
that she can party with his son
after their wedding.

00:59:15.690 --> 00:59:16.530
Nilofer.

00:59:17.070 --> 00:59:17.880
What a family!

00:59:19.820 --> 00:59:22.660
As far as I know,
they are well prepared.

00:59:23.440 --> 00:59:24.450
Shall I say something?

00:59:24.900 --> 00:59:26.440
Marry that guy.

00:59:26.770 --> 00:59:27.880
I promise you.

00:59:28.140 --> 00:59:31.110
You won't get such a family
and groom anywhere else.

00:59:32.210 --> 00:59:35.670
Hey, what you're doing doesn't seem
to send away the groom's family.

00:59:35.770 --> 00:59:37.660
It seems like you're planning
to get me kicked out.

00:59:37.720 --> 00:59:38.550
That's good.

00:59:38.660 --> 00:59:40.640
If they kick you out, there
won't be any marriage torture.

00:59:41.120 --> 00:59:42.380
Yes, you are right.

00:59:43.050 --> 00:59:44.420
Hey, please.

00:59:44.880 --> 00:59:45.670
Hey,

00:59:46.100 --> 00:59:47.200
What are you doing here?

00:59:47.340 --> 00:59:49.190
Look at the groom who is sitting.

00:59:49.780 --> 00:59:51.000
You go, Mom.
I will come.

00:59:51.630 --> 00:59:54.070
Greet everyone properly, okay?

00:59:55.070 --> 00:59:55.960
Come soon.

01:00:23.010 --> 01:00:23.840
Greetings.

01:00:26.620 --> 01:00:28.310
Son, do you like the girl?

01:00:29.160 --> 01:00:31.090
I like her, sir.
- Superb.

01:00:31.400 --> 01:00:33.390
Then, let's fix the date.

01:00:33.660 --> 01:00:34.500
It's okay for us.

01:00:34.540 --> 01:00:35.700
What do you say, dear?
- Okay.

01:00:36.750 --> 01:00:38.380
Oh, yes.
- I don't like the groom.

01:00:43.300 --> 01:00:45.280
I don't want to get married.

01:00:47.880 --> 01:00:49.000
I like someone else.

01:00:49.710 --> 01:00:50.920
Mom, what is this?

01:00:51.050 --> 01:00:52.530
We arranged this
after asking you, right?

01:00:53.580 --> 01:00:54.820
You could have told me then.

01:00:54.900 --> 01:00:56.300
I didn't feel like
telling you then.

01:00:56.710 --> 01:00:58.900
Dear.
- What should I tell them now?

01:01:03.650 --> 01:01:04.510
Who is that guy?

01:01:14.410 --> 01:01:15.830
Who is that guy?
- Kiran.

01:02:40.418 --> 01:02:43.548
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:02:45.508 --> 01:02:47.958
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:02:50.608 --> 01:02:53.428
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:02:55.288 --> 01:02:57.478
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:02:57.728 --> 01:03:00.128
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:03:00.308 --> 01:03:02.878
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:03:03.118 --> 01:03:05.598
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:03:08.148 --> 01:03:10.608
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:03:13.098 --> 01:03:15.638
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:03:17.788 --> 01:03:22.018
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:03:36.808 --> 01:03:38.768
I get late every day
just trying to start the bike.

01:03:38.938 --> 01:03:40.608
It's a third-hand bike.
That's why.

01:03:40.868 --> 01:03:42.658
Don't complain about it.

01:03:43.638 --> 01:03:46.028
Why are you
so happy to irritate me?

01:03:46.458 --> 01:03:47.658
It's a third-hand bike, right?

01:03:50.378 --> 01:03:51.818
Him?
- Don't worry.

01:03:51.848 --> 01:03:54.758
She can't leave. It won't start.
It's a third-hand bike.

01:03:55.228 --> 01:03:57.808
Reena, I told you
the other day. Did you forget?

01:03:58.998 --> 01:04:00.348
What are you talking about?

01:04:01.108 --> 01:04:04.138
I wanted to throw a party
for all of you, on Radhi's behalf.

01:04:04.218 --> 01:04:05.598
Did you forget?
- Wait, wait.

01:04:06.508 --> 01:04:08.728
Why are you throwing
a party on behalf of her?

01:04:08.788 --> 01:04:10.808
Because I am very happy now.

01:04:11.188 --> 01:04:14.548
I got a good friend like you
in so many years. - Yes.

01:04:14.828 --> 01:04:16.638
She is also a good friend now.

01:04:16.978 --> 01:04:18.578
I have to do something for her.

01:04:18.868 --> 01:04:20.138
Can I also come to the party?

01:04:23.348 --> 01:04:24.248
Okay.

01:04:24.558 --> 01:04:26.778
Reena, don't forget
to bring your friends.

01:04:26.968 --> 01:04:27.938
Call Rocky also.

01:04:28.188 --> 01:04:30.018
Rocky is a good boy, you know.

01:04:30.458 --> 01:04:31.388
Reena.

01:04:31.688 --> 01:04:34.308
You come. I will bring
my grandchildren.

01:04:34.508 --> 01:04:35.678
Okay. Bye.

01:04:38.398 --> 01:04:39.348
Did you see him?

01:04:40.378 --> 01:04:42.298
He is throwing a party
since the problem is over.

01:04:42.938 --> 01:04:44.878
He doesn't know
that you were the reason for it.

01:04:45.028 --> 01:04:46.138
What to do?

01:04:46.628 --> 01:04:48.228
It's a third-hand bike.
Throw it away.

01:04:48.548 --> 01:04:49.548
I will buy you a new one.

01:04:49.868 --> 01:04:51.728
Why are you glaring at me, Doctor?

01:04:55.218 --> 01:04:56.058
Hi, Kiran.

01:05:03.658 --> 01:05:04.478
Nilofer.

01:05:06.408 --> 01:05:07.518
Well..

01:05:07.588 --> 01:05:09.318
You told everyone
that you like me yesterday.

01:05:10.358 --> 01:05:11.348
Is that true?

01:05:11.738 --> 01:05:12.588
Yes.

01:05:13.518 --> 01:05:14.728
Hey, sorry.

01:05:14.988 --> 01:05:16.518
That was not my intention.

01:05:17.118 --> 01:05:19.448
Hey, I don't have
that intention either.

01:05:19.698 --> 01:05:21.458
I didn't know how
to escape from there.

01:05:21.588 --> 01:05:22.768
So you were the scapegoat.

01:05:23.368 --> 01:05:26.178
You two spoke ill of me.
Shouldn't I talk about you?

01:05:27.638 --> 01:05:29.108
Are you sure?
- Sure.

01:05:29.738 --> 01:05:30.618
So all chill?

01:05:31.138 --> 01:05:31.978
Super chill.

01:05:34.408 --> 01:05:35.518
I am relieved now.

01:05:36.058 --> 01:05:37.978
I didn't know what to do
after you said that.

01:05:38.448 --> 01:05:41.068
Your family was focusing on me
when I tried to talk to you.

01:05:42.208 --> 01:05:43.138
But it's okay.

01:05:43.518 --> 01:05:44.428
You acted well.

01:05:44.818 --> 01:05:46.928
No one would have believed you
if you had pointed at Rocky.

01:05:47.278 --> 01:05:49.728
But you pointed at me.
Even I believed it.

01:05:50.068 --> 01:05:51.058
It was so real.

01:05:52.838 --> 01:05:55.558
When are we going
on a date with Reena?

01:05:56.408 --> 01:05:57.448
You should come.

01:05:58.328 --> 01:05:59.368
Without me?

01:05:59.698 --> 01:06:01.078
You can't escape from me.

01:06:02.408 --> 01:06:04.758
My parents wanted to meet you.

01:06:05.578 --> 01:06:06.448
What?

01:06:07.038 --> 01:06:09.548
You said that
everything is fine now.

01:06:09.798 --> 01:06:12.858
Yes, I'm fine.
But my parents want to meet you.

01:06:13.098 --> 01:06:14.558
Nilofer, don't play with me.

01:06:15.098 --> 01:06:16.178
I am serious.

01:06:16.258 --> 01:06:19.128
When I mentioned your name,
they wanted to talk to you.

01:06:19.308 --> 01:06:21.178
I tried to convince them.

01:06:21.638 --> 01:06:23.708
But I couldn't.
So I gave them your number.

01:06:24.548 --> 01:06:26.408
You don't have to save me now.
Save yourself.

01:06:26.638 --> 01:06:27.448
Bye.

01:06:27.548 --> 01:06:28.588
Hey.
- Bye..

01:06:29.708 --> 01:06:30.768
My phone is ringing.

01:06:34.208 --> 01:06:36.268
'Why is he sitting alone?'

01:06:38.958 --> 01:06:39.798
Good morning.

01:06:40.738 --> 01:06:41.678
Morning.

01:06:43.718 --> 01:06:45.428
Even though the coffee
here is not good

01:06:45.778 --> 01:06:49.178
it feels like we started the day
only after a cup of coffee.

01:06:49.378 --> 01:06:50.288
Right?

01:06:52.758 --> 01:06:54.098
Why are you down?

01:06:55.438 --> 01:06:56.388
I don't know.

01:06:56.568 --> 01:06:58.048
I feel mentally drained.

01:06:58.678 --> 01:07:01.218
It's difficult
to make you work so much.

01:07:01.258 --> 01:07:02.428
Who is that duty doctor?

01:07:03.308 --> 01:07:04.148
Reena.

01:07:04.478 --> 01:07:06.308
I don't lounge around like you do.

01:07:06.768 --> 01:07:08.688
I finished
all my work in the morning.

01:07:10.568 --> 01:07:11.928
Are you really down?

01:07:14.288 --> 01:07:15.138
Why?

01:07:15.768 --> 01:07:17.138
I wanted to talk to Charu.

01:07:17.888 --> 01:07:19.568
I am busy when she is free.

01:07:20.638 --> 01:07:22.058
She is busy when I am free.

01:07:23.128 --> 01:07:24.388
I couldn't talk to her.

01:07:28.588 --> 01:07:30.308
Shall we go out after the shift?

01:07:32.188 --> 01:07:33.338
Really?
- Yes.

01:07:37.138 --> 01:07:38.308
You and me?

01:07:41.978 --> 01:07:42.848
No.

01:07:43.398 --> 01:07:44.268
That's it.

01:07:44.808 --> 01:07:45.978
Who else is coming?

01:07:47.878 --> 01:07:49.428
Tell me, it's okay.

01:07:50.118 --> 01:07:51.058
Grandpa.

01:07:51.338 --> 01:07:52.388
Sid.

01:07:52.728 --> 01:07:53.638
Divi.

01:07:54.358 --> 01:07:55.228
Uncle Ganesh.

01:07:56.288 --> 01:07:57.448
Now, you and me.

01:07:58.448 --> 01:08:01.268
Reena, why didn't you
invite Dr. Radhi and Mr. Dev?

01:08:01.318 --> 01:08:02.598
You could have invited them too.

01:08:05.008 --> 01:08:05.958
I am not coming.

01:08:06.188 --> 01:08:08.618
You are going out as a family.
Why should I come?

01:08:08.968 --> 01:08:10.798
What are you saying?
- I can't do it.

01:08:10.998 --> 01:08:12.918
You are also a part of my family.

01:08:15.258 --> 01:08:16.248
I know, Reena.

01:08:17.918 --> 01:08:21.508
I know that you didn't
invite me as your family.

01:08:22.328 --> 01:08:23.298
You have a problem.

01:08:23.668 --> 01:08:25.718
You don't want to be alone,
so you are dragging me along.

01:08:26.038 --> 01:08:26.998
Am I right?

01:08:27.928 --> 01:08:28.798
I am your friend.

01:08:29.408 --> 01:08:30.548
Have coffee.

01:08:30.568 --> 01:08:32.198
Drink..
- You drink it.

01:08:32.408 --> 01:08:33.838
I have paid for it.
- Arjun, bro!

01:08:34.338 --> 01:08:35.168
Arjun?

01:08:35.248 --> 01:08:36.628
Come here.
- Don't invite him.

01:08:37.248 --> 01:08:39.128
Oh, no, why did you call him here?

01:08:39.278 --> 01:08:40.498
Wait a minute.

01:08:40.528 --> 01:08:41.638
Won't you be quiet?

01:08:41.798 --> 01:08:43.758
Hi..
- Hi, bro. - Hi.

01:08:44.528 --> 01:08:47.748
We are going out after work today.
Are you coming?

01:08:48.608 --> 01:08:49.588
Who are "we"?

01:08:49.978 --> 01:08:50.958
We are..

01:08:51.108 --> 01:08:54.168
Me, Reena, Sid,
Divi, Mr. Thiyagarajan.

01:08:54.258 --> 01:08:56.158
Mr. Ganesh is also coming.
There won't be enough space.

01:08:56.318 --> 01:08:57.878
Everyone is going out as a family.

01:08:57.978 --> 01:08:59.648
Will it be good if we go along?

01:08:59.938 --> 01:09:00.878
Arjun.

01:09:01.138 --> 01:09:03.538
Didn't you know that when you
stood in front of Reena's house?

01:09:09.278 --> 01:09:10.668
If it's okay with Reena

01:09:11.868 --> 01:09:12.958
I don't have any problem.

01:09:16.078 --> 01:09:16.958
What is this?

01:09:17.698 --> 01:09:18.708
Okay, come.

01:09:19.448 --> 01:09:20.298
Let's see.

01:09:21.168 --> 01:09:22.088
Okay.
- Okay.

01:09:24.618 --> 01:09:25.498
The file is here.

01:09:25.558 --> 01:09:26.888
Wait, I will get it.
- Okay, Doctor.

01:09:27.058 --> 01:09:27.958
Hi.

01:09:28.708 --> 01:09:29.588
Hi, senior.

01:09:34.808 --> 01:09:36.288
Take it.
- Okay, Doctor.

01:09:36.478 --> 01:09:37.348
Thank you.
- Okay.

01:09:39.298 --> 01:09:43.148
Did you fill up the discharge
summary for Preetha, like I asked?

01:09:43.558 --> 01:09:44.838
Yes, I did.

01:09:45.868 --> 01:09:47.598
I've asked them to discharge
her in the evening.

01:09:54.918 --> 01:09:58.858
Is this dance necessary
in your mom's current situation?

01:09:59.898 --> 01:10:02.608
We have to change
her medication, right?

01:10:03.548 --> 01:10:04.418
I know.

01:10:07.648 --> 01:10:09.148
Hey, look at me.

01:10:12.108 --> 01:10:13.088
I know, senior.

01:10:13.578 --> 01:10:15.378
I know that we have
to change her medication.

01:10:15.628 --> 01:10:18.118
I know that it is difficult
for her to dance in this situation.

01:10:20.188 --> 01:10:21.298
What do you want me to do?

01:10:21.488 --> 01:10:23.588
I have to act as if I am
happy in front of her.

01:10:24.298 --> 01:10:26.908
I have to act like you are just
a senior to me in this hospital.

01:10:28.108 --> 01:10:29.968
You broke up with me
before she got admitted here.

01:10:30.198 --> 01:10:32.918
And I have to act normal
as if nothing happened.

01:10:41.918 --> 01:10:43.068
I don't know, senior.

01:10:43.488 --> 01:10:46.378
I don't know what I feel,
whom I should talk to

01:10:48.098 --> 01:10:49.918
whom I should express it to..

01:10:50.618 --> 01:10:52.118
I don't know anything, senior.

01:10:56.608 --> 01:10:58.198
Hey, get up.

01:11:01.498 --> 01:11:03.198
I am talking to you.
Get up.

01:11:18.368 --> 01:11:20.348
Everything will be alright, okay?

01:11:32.528 --> 01:11:33.708
Everything will be alright.

01:11:34.648 --> 01:11:35.738
Don't worry.

01:11:42.588 --> 01:11:45.028
Oh, God.
Why am I seeing all this?

01:11:45.248 --> 01:11:46.338
It is just acidity.

01:11:46.698 --> 01:11:48.798
I will prescribe you some Pan 40
for five days.

01:11:49.058 --> 01:11:51.088
You have to take it
an hour before meals.

01:11:51.318 --> 01:11:52.198
Okay?

01:11:52.388 --> 01:11:53.648
Let's meet after a week.

01:11:54.458 --> 01:11:55.998
You eat well.

01:11:56.308 --> 01:11:58.168
You shouldn't eat unwanted food.
Okay?

01:11:58.448 --> 01:12:00.168
Amaya..
- Amaya?

01:12:00.748 --> 01:12:02.048
Hey, Kamal, check her.
- What happened?

01:12:02.868 --> 01:12:03.798
What happened?

01:12:03.858 --> 01:12:06.738
She fainted due to dehydration.

01:12:06.878 --> 01:12:09.308
If she works overtime every day,
won't she get dehydrated?

01:12:09.938 --> 01:12:11.848
She didn't sleep well.
She didn't rest well.

01:12:11.888 --> 01:12:12.878
That's why she fainted.

01:12:13.658 --> 01:12:15.358
Amaya is not the first person.

01:12:16.158 --> 01:12:18.568
What is it, Aruna?
It feels like you're blaming me.

01:12:19.248 --> 01:12:22.108
Sir, you only saw Amaya fainting.

01:12:22.348 --> 01:12:25.058
Two nurses fainted last week.

01:12:25.398 --> 01:12:27.138
I checked the reason.

01:12:27.268 --> 01:12:28.678
It was due to dehydration.

01:12:28.728 --> 01:12:30.458
The reason is work pressure.

01:12:30.758 --> 01:12:32.168
Are you threatening me?

01:12:32.698 --> 01:12:34.118
If you want
to file a complaint, do it.

01:12:34.688 --> 01:12:37.698
You think you are the only ones
running this hospital.

01:12:38.108 --> 01:12:39.418
Sir, that's the truth.

01:12:39.908 --> 01:12:43.448
If we are not here,
the doctors here will suffer.

01:12:43.688 --> 01:12:46.008
Patient reports, test
reports, scan reports..

01:12:46.128 --> 01:12:49.708
We do everything from writing up
discharge summaries

01:12:49.898 --> 01:12:51.568
to stock up medicines
in the pharmacy.

01:12:51.788 --> 01:12:54.448
We even get the gate
passed for the patients.

01:12:54.638 --> 01:12:56.998
If it is so difficult,
why don't you resign?

01:12:57.168 --> 01:12:58.418
No one will stop you.

01:13:01.038 --> 01:13:03.818
They support Radhi
and try to mess with me.

01:13:04.048 --> 01:13:05.048
What did you just say?

01:13:06.878 --> 01:13:08.068
You are crossing a line.

01:13:08.228 --> 01:13:10.118
You will know our worth
only if we are not here.

01:13:10.228 --> 01:13:11.168
What you will do?

01:13:11.398 --> 01:13:13.738
You can't do
a single freaking thing.

01:13:13.928 --> 01:13:15.218
Sir.
- Are you okay, Amaya?

01:13:16.298 --> 01:13:17.458
Kamal, take care of her.

01:13:26.368 --> 01:13:28.298
Come on, kids.
We are getting late.

01:13:28.528 --> 01:13:31.708
Divi, Sid.
Where are you going?

01:13:31.868 --> 01:13:33.498
We are going out to eat.

01:13:33.718 --> 01:13:34.978
You got your job back, right?

01:13:35.098 --> 01:13:36.828
So Grandpa is treating us.

01:13:37.818 --> 01:13:38.698
Where are you going?

01:13:39.998 --> 01:13:41.838
A restaurant.
A restaurant nearby.

01:13:42.748 --> 01:13:43.628
How you are going?

01:13:45.148 --> 01:13:47.268
A-Auto.. We'll take an auto.

01:13:47.378 --> 01:13:48.298
When will you come?

01:13:48.788 --> 01:13:50.128
We will..
- Mom.

01:13:50.318 --> 01:13:51.798
Why are you asking
so many questions?

01:13:51.898 --> 01:13:54.318
Why don't you just join us?
- No!

01:13:54.458 --> 01:13:57.658
She has to rest after her work.

01:13:57.768 --> 01:14:00.298
Let her rest.
- It's okay. I will also come.

01:14:00.408 --> 01:14:03.918
I want to spend some time
alone with my grandkids.

01:14:04.018 --> 01:14:05.748
Why can't I come with my kids?

01:14:05.958 --> 01:14:07.648
I didn't mean that.

01:14:08.458 --> 01:14:11.378
I can pay for it.
- Money is not the issue.

01:14:11.418 --> 01:14:14.108
I want to spend some time alone.
- I will come.

01:14:17.618 --> 01:14:19.668
Sid. Divi. Come, let's go.

01:14:21.158 --> 01:14:22.838
Oh, God!

01:14:27.208 --> 01:14:28.108
Hi.

01:14:28.768 --> 01:14:29.588
Sir, how are you?

01:14:29.988 --> 01:14:31.628
Hi. Good boy, Rocky.

01:14:32.918 --> 01:14:35.218
Both of you talk on the phone often.

01:14:35.338 --> 01:14:36.818
Why are you acting now?

01:14:36.958 --> 01:14:38.308
It's been so long since we met.

01:14:38.448 --> 01:14:40.128
It's been many days.
- Months.

01:14:41.738 --> 01:14:44.198
Did you bring liquor for the party?

01:14:44.978 --> 01:14:47.548
How could you ask me that?
- Why, what's wrong?

01:14:47.978 --> 01:14:49.998
Am I a drunkard?
- Yes.

01:14:50.588 --> 01:14:51.588
No?

01:14:51.878 --> 01:14:53.608
I am a doctor.
- Okay..

01:14:54.948 --> 01:14:56.948
The stock is in the car.
Do you want it?

01:14:57.018 --> 01:14:58.438
Not now.
I will take it later.

01:14:58.628 --> 01:14:59.708
I told you.
Good boy.

01:15:00.898 --> 01:15:02.798
Hi.
- Hi..

01:15:03.138 --> 01:15:04.688
Hey, Arjun, welcome..

01:15:04.858 --> 01:15:05.798
Not bad.

01:15:06.948 --> 01:15:08.958
You used to flirt with her
in front of our house.

01:15:09.008 --> 01:15:10.508
Now you're having dinner with her.

01:15:10.658 --> 01:15:12.008
I like it.
- Oh, sir.

01:15:12.598 --> 01:15:13.958
We are just friends.

01:15:15.128 --> 01:15:17.088
Isn't it, Reena?
- Why are you asking her?

01:15:17.218 --> 01:15:18.398
Ask me, I will tell him.

01:15:18.478 --> 01:15:21.398
You both will be
just friends till the end.

01:15:21.668 --> 01:15:23.798
Hey.
Can you be quiet?

01:15:25.998 --> 01:15:27.818
Bro, where are you going?

01:15:28.058 --> 01:15:30.458
Come here.
Sit next to me, I won't mind.

01:15:31.038 --> 01:15:32.168
Come on..

01:15:44.128 --> 01:15:45.328
Cold drink?

01:15:45.648 --> 01:15:46.858
Then it must be juice.

01:15:53.168 --> 01:15:55.458
Hi.
- Why are you late, Thyagarajan?

01:15:56.398 --> 01:15:59.398
I think no one in the family
comes on time except Dr. Radhi.

01:16:00.558 --> 01:16:03.148
He is always murmuring something.

01:16:03.898 --> 01:16:05.408
Be careful, everyone.

01:16:05.738 --> 01:16:06.638
Why?

01:16:13.688 --> 01:16:17.088
Sir, Divi is a kid.
We won't get scared of her.

01:16:17.248 --> 01:16:18.248
Divi is a kid.

01:16:18.458 --> 01:16:21.378
But my kid who gave birth
to Divi is also coming along.

01:16:25.988 --> 01:16:26.918
Hey.

01:16:26.988 --> 01:16:28.588
Look what you have done.

01:16:40.398 --> 01:16:43.778
Why should you treat them to dinner
because I got my job back?

01:16:44.448 --> 01:16:45.648
That is..

01:16:45.768 --> 01:16:50.628
Like me, they are also happy
that you are back to work.

01:16:50.788 --> 01:16:51.948
Happy, that's it.

01:16:52.238 --> 01:16:55.738
Ma'am, he is the odd one out.
- Shut up.

01:16:57.598 --> 01:16:59.918
Why did you bring the kids
to give them a treat?

01:17:01.848 --> 01:17:04.238
Who else do you know here
apart from Mr. Ganesh?

01:17:04.508 --> 01:17:05.778
You have called everyone.

01:17:06.348 --> 01:17:07.848
That is..

01:17:07.868 --> 01:17:10.588
The kids came with me
since it's a dinner treat.

01:17:11.058 --> 01:17:13.948
We didn't expect you to come along.

01:17:14.458 --> 01:17:18.298
We are just going to have fun.

01:17:18.908 --> 01:17:21.798
Please don't spoil our mood
by getting angry.

01:17:28.908 --> 01:17:29.778
Thank God!

01:17:42.368 --> 01:17:43.958
Veg or non-veg?

01:17:44.108 --> 01:17:45.738
It depends on the person
who's paying the bill.

01:17:53.038 --> 01:17:57.568
We just came to eat. Why are
you all looking at me like that?

01:18:17.518 --> 01:18:18.838
What a taste!

01:18:21.438 --> 01:18:22.858
Hey.
- Rocky.

01:18:23.828 --> 01:18:25.148
Can't you drink it quietly?

01:18:28.478 --> 01:18:30.588
S-Since you are all so quiet
and not saying anything

01:18:31.538 --> 01:18:33.988
me drinking the soup
sounded loud to you.

01:18:34.408 --> 01:18:35.708
I drank it quietly.

01:18:38.788 --> 01:18:40.338
What do you want
to talk about, Rocky?

01:18:42.548 --> 01:18:43.628
M-Ma'am.

01:18:43.758 --> 01:18:45.898
I am the last person
you should be angry with.

01:18:46.738 --> 01:18:48.858
We didn't do anything wrong.

01:18:49.128 --> 01:18:50.758
There is no reason
to be angry with us.

01:18:51.018 --> 01:18:53.238
Mr. Thyagarajan invited us.
So we came.

01:18:56.768 --> 01:18:58.398
I should apologise to you both.

01:18:59.398 --> 01:19:00.818
I am responsible for everything.

01:19:02.708 --> 01:19:05.818
I should have handled
the CEO election professionally.

01:19:06.848 --> 01:19:10.358
You two are suffering
because of my stupidity.

01:19:10.458 --> 01:19:12.068
No, Arjun.
I am the one at fault.

01:19:12.278 --> 01:19:14.528
If I hadn't come to Chennai,
none of this would've happened.

01:19:14.588 --> 01:19:17.198
She would have been happy
with her family.

01:19:17.338 --> 01:19:18.988
Without any sorry or guilt.

01:19:19.608 --> 01:19:21.288
Please be quiet.

01:19:21.368 --> 01:19:23.038
This is not the time
for confessions.

01:19:23.168 --> 01:19:24.338
You shut up.
- Rocky.

01:19:28.238 --> 01:19:30.668
From the day I came here,
I was asking everyone

01:19:31.048 --> 01:19:33.318
about the reason
for her resignation.

01:19:34.258 --> 01:19:35.588
No one answered me.

01:19:36.888 --> 01:19:38.498
But since the time we entered here

01:19:38.958 --> 01:19:41.648
there is a big discussion
going on about that topic.

01:19:41.708 --> 01:19:42.628
What is happening?

01:19:44.318 --> 01:19:45.608
Sid, Divi, let's go.

01:19:51.508 --> 01:19:52.798
We shouldn't have come here, Uncle.

01:19:54.458 --> 01:19:55.518
Wait, I'll also come.

01:20:03.398 --> 01:20:04.318
Hello.

01:20:04.678 --> 01:20:05.588
Okay.

01:20:07.978 --> 01:20:09.988
What happened?
- I'll be there.

01:20:13.038 --> 01:20:14.838
H-He took away the juice too.

01:20:19.018 --> 01:20:22.498
Hey, who is giving a treat to whom?

01:20:24.648 --> 01:20:26.148
Should I pay the bill for this?

01:20:31.228 --> 01:20:32.548
I didn't even bring the wallet.

01:20:35.498 --> 01:20:36.378
Okay.

01:20:41.028 --> 01:20:43.458
Okay, I'm going to sleep.
I'm tired.

01:20:44.008 --> 01:20:45.958
Let's meet in the morning.

01:20:46.548 --> 01:20:49.818
Sorry, I didn't expect this
to happen.

01:20:50.638 --> 01:20:51.668
It's okay, sir. Leave it.

01:20:52.278 --> 01:20:53.298
What can you do?

01:20:54.678 --> 01:20:55.588
I'm going home.

01:20:55.958 --> 01:20:57.638
I have to pack.
I'm leaving for my hometown.

01:20:57.778 --> 01:20:58.658
Why?

01:21:00.438 --> 01:21:02.848
I mean..
You came here for Dr. Radhi, right?

01:21:03.518 --> 01:21:05.198
Why are you leaving so soon?

01:21:06.148 --> 01:21:07.088
That's it, dear.

01:21:07.728 --> 01:21:10.238
My work here is done.
Kids are happy.

01:21:10.368 --> 01:21:12.068
What else can I do here?

01:21:12.678 --> 01:21:13.838
I have to leave.

01:21:17.368 --> 01:21:18.338
Bye, dear.

01:21:20.788 --> 01:21:21.958
I am Dr. Radhi's daughter.

01:21:32.568 --> 01:21:33.418
I know.

